":"是唐宋时期提倡古文、反对骈文的文体改革运动","bbox":[687.097,494.759,321.465,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0062"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0021","text":"其核心是反对六朝以来形式僵化、内容空洞的骈文","bbox":[687.097,538.769,336.773,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0063"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0022","text":"提倡恢复先秦两汉时期质朴自由、言之有物的散文","bbox":[687.097,582.779,336.773,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0064"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0023","text":"传统，以复兴儒学，挽救时局","bbox":[687.097,605.741,199.002,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0065"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0024","text":"经典名句","bbox":[589.51,693.761,61.232,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0066"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0025","text":"《师说》：闻道有先后，术业有专攻，如是而已","bbox":[687.097,649.751,313.811,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0067"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0026","text":"《醉翁亭记》：醉翁之意不在酒，在乎山水之间也","bbox":[687.097,693.761,329.119,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0068"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0027","text":"《游褒禅山记》：世之奇伟、瑰怪，非常之观，常在","bbox":[687.097,737.771,344.427,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0069"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0028","text":"于险远，而人之所罕至焉，故非有志者不能至也","bbox":[687.097,760.733,321.465,15.308],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0070"]},{"id":"history-p024-b0029","text":"24","bbox":[587.275,810.711,16.0,21.344],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0071"]}],"questions":[{"id":"history-p024-q001","number":1,"type":"fill-in","answer":"韩愈、柳宗元","bbox":[802.863,39.35,91.847,15.308],"fontSize":15.308,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"韩愈、柳宗元","bbox":[802.863,39.35,91.847,15.308],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0008"],"aliases":[],"context":"主持唐宋古文运动唐二家（____）"},{"id":"history-p024-q002","number":2,"type":"fill-in","answer":"唐宋八大家","bbox":[461.306,61.355,76.539,15.308],"fontSize":15.308,"color":"#8e24aa","segments":[{"text":"唐宋八大家","bbox":[461.306,61.355,76.539,15.308],"color":"#8e24aa"}],"nodeIds":["history-p024-n0004"],"aliases":[],"context":"____的中心人物"},{"id":"history-p024-q003","number":3,"type":"fill-in","answer":"苏轼、苏洵、苏辙、欧阳修、曾巩、王安石","bbox":[802.863,83.36,290.849,15.308],"fontSize":